  "title": "Irmik Helvasi (Turkish Semolina Halva)",
  "description": "Irmik Helvasi (semolina halva) is a traditional Turkish recipe for a classic dessert made from semolina flour, butter, pine nuts, and syrup.",
  "authors": [
